ているため、周囲に細かく気を配る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作中で一番の胸囲を誇るが、アンダーとの差はそれほどでもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸が大きいというよりも、すべてが大きい （本人もやや気にしてる様子）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【ねこみみとしっぽに関して】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ねこみみ＆しっぽに関しては恥ずかしいという認識。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……というのは外向けの言で、内心はカワイイと思ってる。 見た目の大人っぽさに比べて、やや子供っぽいところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「き、今日のところはこのくらいで勘弁してあげるというか… えと、その… は、はうぅ……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26183"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"94 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3826","sourceWorkId":"20426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3826","sourceWorkId":"20426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3826","sourceWorkId":"20426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"68 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3826","sourceWorkId":"20426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d497097021a1b0f9683f0885ce109a01fadbcf8e5817ad2535eba0e77091279.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/651d7545d5f3be72ca9daa63b897ed9f4d180964979ac32e568482add3e551ba.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水愛","creatorId":"vndb:s416","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s416","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s416","name":"清水 愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:106519:26183:4064:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21807","characterName":"宮村 千愛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26184","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"106519"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3827"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21807"},"originalCharacterName":"宮村 千愛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1002"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"74"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"145"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"76"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masshigura self proclaimed owner. When attending to customers, she would always pretend to be well behaved. When praised she becomes very happy, but because she isn't straightforward, there is always a tone of arrogance in her answers. She is sensitive about her pettanko chest and is envious towards her friend Yuuna's busty figure, so she drinks milk everyday and do gymnastics. Thinks that cat ears and tail is very cute, and that they're a perfect match for herself who is also very cute."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21807"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の働く事になるネコミミカフェの自称看板娘で、年齢は主人公の１つ下の学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お店での接客時は基本的にネコを被っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自信家で褒められるのが好きだが素直じゃない性格なので、褒められると嬉しい気持ちとは裏腹に生意気な態度を取ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしその生意気な態度が照れ隠しな事がバレバレなので、周囲からはほほえましく思われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りな所あり、主人公に対しても最初はそっけない態度を取る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが寂しがりな所もあり、懐いた人にはとことん依存するタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸が無い事を気にしていて、毎日の牛乳とバストアップ体操は外せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親友のヒロイン４の巨乳がうらやましくて仕方ない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3827","sourceWorkId":"20426","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネコミミカフェの看板娘（自称）で、年齢は主人公の1つ下で学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お店での接客時はたいていネコを被っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に褒められると嬉しいのだが、素直じゃないのでつい生意気な口を利いてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸が小さいことを気にしていて、毎日の牛乳とバストアップ体操は欠かせない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親友の優奈の巨乳がうらやましい……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【ねこみみとしっぽに関して】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ねこみみとしっぽに関してはカワイイからありだと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むしろカワイイ自分にはベストマッチだと思っていて、ずっとこのままでいいとすら思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「やっぱり私の接客はプロですね！　……ほめてくれてもいいんですよ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26184"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"74 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3827","sourceWorkId":"20426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"145 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3827","sourceWorkId":"20426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"76 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3827","sourceWorkId":"20426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3827","sourceWorkId":"20426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d220e6559ef6e07cc25f7cb32920d9bf20c6d95733f010272280746c3f202b24.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb177f0cdf438172a9e415e241e6a9be0fe7c2370a21f3c266b91c19931a2ddc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡嶋妙","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:106519:26184:4646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21809","characterName":"小日向 優奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26186","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"106519"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3829"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21809"},"originalCharacterName":"小日向 優奈","ch